          sortingKey: "000000"
          type: markdown
          content: >-
            # Account health


            Scores every paying account for churn risk from 0 to 100 and keeps the reasons. Scheduled every

            weekday after the warehouse load, it posts the accounts that crossed the threshold to Slack, each

            linking to its page in the Account health app. The app runs the same notebook with **Post to Slack**

            off.


            Set `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL` and `ACCOUNT_HEALTH_URL` (the app link) as environment variables.
          metadata: {}
